  title: The Informant's Wall
  content: You find the informant, but reaching them is another matter. A tight circle
    of regulars closes ranks before you can get close, shielding the source with
    hard stares and harder shoulders. If you want a conversation, you first need
    to break through the people standing between you and the truth.
